OL,3,GNEWSAProject aims to protect rare
OL,4,Aarctic-alpine plants
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project aiming to help protect rare
OL,7,Farctic-alpine plants is set to launch.
OL,9,FTeesdale Special Flora Research and
OL,10,FConservation Trust has been given a
OL,11,F#65,000 grant for a three-year scheme.
OL,13,FIt will see volunteers work with the
OL,14,Ftrust to collect seeds and put them on
OL,15,Fthe fells of Upper Teesdale.
OL,17,FThe trust's founder, Dr Margaret
OL,18,FBradshaw, said the group wanted to
OL,19,Fraise awareness of the fragility of
OL,20,Fspecial flora in the area.
